    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222830/extras/fddb1c42ac367e032fe9d7810f1c339c.avif?t=1752828554\" width=615 height=71 /></span><br><br>Inspired by DreamWorks Animation\u2019s Gabby\u2019s Dollhouse, fans can now throw the greatest party ever with Gabby and Pandy Paws! Hop into the catavator and see the colorful world come to life.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222830/extras/0ad7c8ce745f3cc9df1333bdbc73a3f0.poster.avif?t=1752828554\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222830/extras/0ad7c8ce745f3cc9df1333bdbc73a3f0.webm?t=1752828554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222830/extras/0ad7c8ce745f3cc9df1333bdbc73a3f0.mp4?t=1752828554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222830/extras/2050cbaa8b9e91d1d1925cb8627f9475.avif?t=1752828554\" width=615 height=71 /></span><br><br>First stop, Crafting World with Mama and Baby Box. Get creative with items you find around the house. Then see what awaits you in the Fairy Tail Garden with Kitty Fairy. Does floating through space sound like a groovy plan? DJ Catnip thinks so. Boogie down to the music room and blast off to planet Caturn. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222830/extras/bcf327b35f5299797182542f6c6915ab.poster.avif?t=1752828554\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222830/extras/bcf327b35f5299797182542f6c6915ab.webm?t=1752828554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222830/extras/bcf327b35f5299797182542f6c6915ab.mp4?t=1752828554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222830/extras/791975b8517a8970a40b0389207c13c2.avif?t=1752828554\" width=615 height=71 /></span><br><br>Every party needs the purr-fect cake. Join Cakey Cat to find gummy worms, cookies, sprinkles in Sweet Treat Mountain. Race over to the Playroom to learn how to leap over obstacles, duck under foam blocks and speed through hoops with Carlita. Dive into Mermaid-lantis with MerCat to see if you can find a treasure chest. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222830/extras/eeec741da7a3e47890921cf9ed4f83a4.poster.avif?t=1752828554\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222830/extras/eeec741da7a3e47890921cf9ed4f83a4.webm?t=1752828554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222830/extras/eeec741da7a3e47890921cf9ed4f83a4.mp4?t=1752828554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222830/extras/3011b94bae3ab9d5ef429c1633082b3f.avif?t=1752828554\" width=615 height=71 /></span><br><br>Take on challenges and play minigames solo or with friends in local co-op mode to find items for the party and get rewarded with outfits to customize Gabby. Add sparkle to an astronaut suit and top it off with a chef\u2019s hat for an out-of-this-world look!  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222830/extras/736ea7075fb4002919e8582273175436.poster.avif?t=1752828554\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222830/extras/736ea7075fb4002919e8582273175436.webm?t=1752828554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222830/extras/736ea7075fb4002919e8582273175436.mp4?t=1752828554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222830/extras/0fa278e07309d1f2109983baf0f98b01.avif?t=1752828554\" width=615 height=71 /></span><br><br>Every corner is filled with chances to learn, play, and create. So, dance, paint, cook, and craft with Gabby and the Gabby Cats. Everyone\u2019s invited!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222830/extras/a47fff4ee4a26416d68d3d15bcc9ae29.poster.avif?t=1752828554\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222830/extras/a47fff4ee4a26416d68d3d15bcc9ae29.webm?t=1752828554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222830/extras/a47fff4ee4a26416d68d3d15bcc9ae29.mp4?t=1752828554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>GET TINY WITH GABBY &amp; PANDY PAWS: </strong>Play solo with Gabby or team up with friends in local co-op to have Pandy Paws join you. <br><br><strong>EXPLORE THE WAY YOU WANT:</strong> Start in the Craft Room, then hop into the catavator to go to the Playroom, Bathroom, Kitchen, Party Room and Garden. Each place is full of magic. <br><br><strong>PARTY WITH THE GABBY CATS: </strong>Pandy Paws, Cakey, Marty the Party Cat, CatRat, MerCat, DJ Catnip, Kitty Fairy, Pillow Cat, Carlita, Baby Box, Mama Box. Every Gabby Cat is ready to play. <br><br><strong>GO WHERE YOUR IMAGINATION TAKES YOU: </strong>Leap into fun activities and minigames as you explore Gabby\u2019s Dollhouse.  <br><strong>LEARN &amp; GROW WITH GABBY:</strong> Get creative and try new hobbies with easy game controls suitable for little hands. <br><br><strong>CELEBRATE IN STYLE: </strong> Personalize Gabby\u2019s look and create a cat-tastic costume for every room. ",
